      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I strongly agree. And I would like to add a few additional comments.\n\nI hope VRChat will provide a contact point for creators who deleted their worlds out of fear during this mistaken enforcement wave, and offer a process to restore, review, and SAFELY re-publish those worlds without risking further sanctions.",
